    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but you said it's self-defined. if there's no objective truth or anything that actually matters on a grand scale, then isn't it just all a toss up? like, if life has no inherent value assigned to it, then choosing to stay or choosing to go is basically the same thing logically. it's just a zero sum game.",
